 process by explaining that I cannot directly create audio files, but can help automate the workflow for TTS generation. I'm focusing on providing concrete examples, specifically detailing how I can create a Python/TTS workflow. To make sure I do not fall into the trap of using banned words, I am checking my response carefully. I am making it direct, without any apologies, and focusing on technical facts.\n\n\n"}
